CHASTITY:
I can't run in these shoes!
ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ສາມາດແລ່ນໄດ້ໃນເກີບເຫຼົ່ານີ້!

571
00:38:05,326 --> 00:38:07,937
Guys, come on. It's up here!BRAX: Go, go, go!
